sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Maya as Maya
    participant Test as /3c-test
    participant Deploy as the team's deploy script
    participant Stage as Staging env
    participant Bug as 3c bug
    participant Issue as GitHub Issue

    Maya->>Test: invoke for the UI change
    Note over Test: sets out what the test must assert
    Test-->>Maya: test-author writes it, test-first

    Maya->>Deploy: run it against staging
    Note over Deploy: the team's own pre-flight checks run
    Deploy->>Stage: deploy succeeds
    Stage-->>Deploy: health check passes
    Deploy-->>Maya: ready for UAT

    Note over Maya: walks the acceptance criteria<br/>manually in staging
    Maya->>Maya: finds a regression in empty-state

    Maya->>Bug: invoke 3c bug
    Note over Bug: captures OS / runtime /<br/>project state / recent commits /<br/>scrubbed env vars
    Bug-->>Issue: files a structured bug issue
    Maya->>Issue: links it from #1287

    Note over Deploy: production still goes<br/>through the team's own approval
